<div class="card section" id="heatCard"><h2>Downstream errors by channel</h2><div class="sub">Uncorrectable codewords per downstream channel (rows, by frequency) over time (columns). Darker = more errors. Errors confined to a few adjacent rows usually mean <b>RF ingress</b>: an outside signal leaking into the cable through a damaged line, loose connector or bad tap. Errors across every row point to wideband noise or weak signal.</div><div id="ingress"></div><div id="heat"></div></div>
